// `?lawful e`, `?valid e`, `?violated e` are claims about an act or duty instance, with free variables bound to every instance.
Fact actor Identified by Alice, Bob
Act greet Actor actor Recipient actor' Holds when True
Duty d Holder actor Claimant actor' Violated when True.
?lawful greet(Alice, Bob).
?lawful greet(actor, actor').
?valid greet(Alice, Bob).
+d(Alice, Bob).
?violated d(Alice, Bob).
